  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Check your peach is ripe before starting this recipe (see Kitchen notes). Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the onion. Cut the peach into 1cm-thick wedges. Cut the haloumi into 5mm-thick slices. Pick half the mint leaves, discarding the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565002/photos/large/prep_ingredients-bbc13949af2b7eccca2c3d1f722d8176.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make pizza sauce: Put the tomato paste, 1 tsp Caribbean seasoning and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl, season with pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565003/photos/large/make_pizza_sauce-b1b459d7755c7a97ce4092de3ab10cae.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray and spread with the pizza sauce, leaving a 1cm border. Top with the onion, peach and haloumi. Put ½ tsp Caribbean seasoning, 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp honey in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine. Drizzle over the haloumi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565004/photos/large/assemble_pizzas-2dc56a25ba5a293b0ff139753e34595f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Bake the pizzas for 8-10 mins until the haloumi is golden and the bases are crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565005/photos/large/bake_pizzas-2eb63ced0860e070db6496837964fe3d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Cut the pizzas into wedges. Scatter over the mint leaves and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565006/photos/large/serve_up-47df639ee209dfda697a959c7f6e0af3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen notes: To help speed up the ripening process, put the peach in a paper bag and loosely close, then leave on the bench for a day or two. Add a banana to the bag to make the peach ripen faster.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1565007/photos/large/kitchen_notes-552bdce00e1e73b6a1a6d33c40051d9a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
